## What Exists
- MCP server implementation: `mcp/enderai-api-mcp/`
- Transport: stdio (`StdioServerTransport`)
- Tools:
  - `enderai_request`
  - `enderai_openapi`
  - `enderai_health_check`

## Runtime Configuration
- `ENDERAI_BASE_URL` default: `https://enderai-backend.onrender.com`
- `ENDERAI_BEARER_TOKEN` optional: bearer auth header
- `ENDERAI_TIMEOUT_MS` default: `30000`

## Build/Test (local)
```sh
# From the repo root:
cd mcp/enderai-api-mcp
npm install
npm run build
npm test
```
